              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Data files for the paper: van der Reijden et al. (2018). North Sea demersal fisheries prefer specific benthic habitats, PLoS One.</p>\r\n<p>Data consists of grid and shape files, and is organized in four zipped folders. A detailed overview of the contents is available in file Data_description.docx</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Environmental_factors.zip</li>\r\n<li>Fisheries_data.zip</li>\r\n<li>Seascapes.zip</li>\r\n<li>Environmental_gradients.zip</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Environmental_factors.zip: file is replaced by a new version on 25/03/2020. The old version unfortunately contained the wrong map Overall_BPI , which was not used in the article. The new version includes the correct map summed_weighted_BPI_SA, which is used in the paper (Figure 1).</p>"
                },
