      {
        "description": "All the environmental factor data used to determine the relevant environmental gradients in the study area are included as raster data (tiff) in ETRS89 UTM31 projection (figure 1, 2, and supplementary figures S1-S19). Most datasets were obtained elsewhere, but all datasets were processed by Karin van der Reijden in R and ArcGIS to have a similar projection, resolution and extent. (R Core Team (2015): R: A language and environment for statistical computing. R Foundation for Statistical Computing, Vienna, Austria. URL: https://www.R-project.org/.) \r\nThis file was replaced by a new version on 25/03/2020. The old version unfortunately contained the wrong map Overall_BPI , which was not used in the article. The new version includes the correct map summed_weighted_BPI_SA, which is used in the paper (Figure 1).",
