      {
        "description": "Dutch VMS and logbook data were obtained from the Dutch ministry of Agriculture, Nature and Food Quality. As they are subject to privacy regulations, only the aggregated data can be publically shared. This folder contains tiff files (ETRS89 UTM31 projection) of both the average fishing activity and the fishing hotspots for the Dutch fisheries as presented in figure 3 of the paper. Grid cells with a fishing intensity of 0 are either not fished, or fished with less than 3 VMS-pings in the grid cell. All modifications and calculations of the raw VMS pings were performed in R.",
